  "description": {

    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Force is the power-oriented member of the PolyTour family, delivering explosive response, strong ball pocketing and excellent tension maintenance. Designed for medium to fast swing speeds, it offers one of the highest power levels within the Yonex polyester lineup while maintaining predictable control.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Force 是 PolyTour 系列中最偏向力量输出的聚酯球线之一。官方定位为具有 Consistent Ball Pocketing 与 High-Response Power，适合中高速挥拍球员，并拥有优秀的保磅能力。相比 PolyTour Pro，它拥有更高的力量与响应速度；相比 PolyTour Strike，则更加容易发力、更加宽容。"
